        1196,
        1873,
        1528
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order that the views expressed in behalf of the City in such instances may represent the position of the City Administration arrived at after due consideration by and consultation with all interested City Agencies, all written replies to such requests are to be forwarded through Mr. Condello.",
